ArchUnitTS

ArchUnitTS is inspired by ArchUnit for Java. During its initial development,
ArchUnitTS used code from the tsarch project:

https://github.com/ts-arch/ts-arch

tsarch is Copyright 2017 mrpatpat <adrian.endrich@googlemail.com> and is
licensed under the MIT License. Its copyright and permission notice are
preserved in this distribution's LICENSE file.

ArchUnitTS has since evolved with its own maintenance, features, integrations,
metrics, reporting, and TypeScript project support.
